*.pyc
test_model.gguf

# Local tool state (security scanner ledger), not part of the project
.mimosa/

# MoonBit profiler output, written by `moon run --trace`
trace.json

# `moon info` writes these into the source tree; they are tool output, not
# source, and `moon publish` packs the directory as it stands (it does not
# read .gitignore), so keeping them out of git also keeps them out of releases.
*.generated.mbti

# The browser preview bundle. `tools/serve_web.py` assembles it from
# `web/index.html` plus the js build; docs/browser.md calls it "a preview
# build, not a published artifact". Tracking it meant every release had to move
# the directory out by hand so `moon publish` would not ship a stale copy.
web/dist/
